# The image only needs the Dockerfile, templates/ and snippets/ (an allowlist).
# Never send certificates, keys or env files to the Docker daemon, even from
# inside the allowlisted directories.
*
!Dockerfile
!templates/
!snippets/

# Credentials, wherever they are (same list as the other build contexts)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.p8
**/*.jks
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*service_account*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/client_secret*.json
**/auth/*.json
**/secrets/
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.git-credentials
